{
 "id": "ss.lib.lovebug-f",
 "name": "Lovebug, female",
 "description": "One lovebug seen from above, head to +x: black body, the red-orange scutum, smoky wings hinged at the thorax with a dark costa and stigma, halteres, six tergites, long three-part legs, eyes set apart, short cerci. `fly` is the wing buzz; `enraged` flushes the thorax and lights the eyes. Archived design sketch, not used by Feelers: the flats' third boss was drafted as \uc0c9\uc138\uae30, three lovebugs coupled at the tail, and set aside for a dragonfly redesign. Kept so the drawing is not lost.",
